{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32591","headline":"宿苍谿馆 · 刘沧","name":"宿苍谿馆","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孤馆门开对碧岑，竹窗灯下听猨吟。\n巴山夜雨别离梦，秦塞旧山迢遰心。\n满地莓苔生近水，几株杨柳自成阴。\n空思知己隔云岭，乡路独归春草深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}